316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (Keywords: Medical Text Simplification, Retrieval-Augmented Generation, Optical Character Recognition, Natural Language Processing, Large Language Models, Health Literacy, Patient- Centric Healthcare.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (Medical reports are essential documents that communicate critical health information between healthcare providers and patients. However, these reports are predominantly written in dense clinical terminology, complex biomedical language, and technical abbreviations that are largely incomprehensible to the average patient. This communication gap creates significant challenges: patients struggle to understand their own diagnoses, lab results, and treatment plans, leading to anxiety, poor health literacy, and suboptimal healthcare decision-making. Existing solutions either require manual interpretation by medical professionals or provide raw report access without meaningful simplification, leaving patients confused and disempowered about their own health status.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E <546869732070726F6A6563742070726573656E74732061205241472D4261736564204D65646963616C205265706F72742053696D706C696669636174696F6E2053797374656D208420616E>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (intelligent, end-to-end pipeline that converts complex medical documents into clear, patient- friendly explanations. The proposed system integrates Optical Character Recognition \(OCR\) for text extraction from PDF and image-based medical reports, Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) for medical entity recognition and semantic parsing, and Retrieval-)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (Augmented Generation \(RAG\) combined with Large Language Models \(LLMs\) for)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (context-aware simplification. The RAG component retrieves authoritative medical knowledge including normal reference ranges, clinical interpretations, and disease associations from trusted sources such as MedlinePlus and Testing.com, ensuring that generated explanations are factually grounded and medically accurate.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (Key contributions of this work include:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
