/E (\(1\) an integrated end-to-end pipeline combining OCR, NLP, RAG, and LLM technologies for medical text simplification; )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 218 0 R
/E (\(2\) a patient-centric design focused on readability and health literacy improvement; )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
