/E (technicians operate under heavy workloads and cannot provide detailed, personalized explanations for every report to every patient. While doctors summarize findings during consultations, patients often forget details or fail to ask clarifying questions. A technology that provides immediate, accurate, and personalized explanations fills this gap without burdening healthcare staff.)
