480 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (Stage 1. Input and OCR Module: The system accepts two input modalities: PDF documents and image files \(JPG, PNG\) of medical reports. For PDF inputs, the system first extracts embedded text; if the PDF is scanned, it rasterizes pages and applies Tesseract OCR. For direct image inputs, preprocessing operations including grayscale conversion, noise reduction \(Gaussian blur\), contrast enhancement \(CLAHE\), and skew correction are applied before OCR. The output is raw extracted text with positional metadata.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
481 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
