/P 229 0 R
/E (Step 4. RAG Knowledge Retrieval: For each test in the structured JSON, the system embeds the test name using a sentence transformer and queries a FAISS index \(1024- dimensional vectors, IVFFlat index type\). The knowledge base contains 5,000+ chunks from MedlinePlus medical encyclopedia and Testing.com lab test guides. Top-k \(k=3\) chunks are retrieved, filtered by relevance threshold \(cosine similarity > 0.75\), and concatenated into a context string.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
