531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 231 0 R
/T (Presentation Tier \(Frontend\): Built with React 18+ and Tailwind CSS. Components include: UploadZone \(drag-and-drop with progress\), ReportViewer \(side-by-side original/simplified\), Dashboard \(historical reports with trend charts\), and ExplanationPanel \(structured output with glossary\). State management uses React Context API. Axios handles API communication.)
/E (Presentation Tier \(Frontend\): Built with React 18+ and Tailwind CSS. Components include: UploadZone \(drag-and-drop with progress\), ReportViewer \(side-by-side original/simplified\), Dashboard \(historical reports with trend charts\), and ExplanationPanel \(structured output with glossary\). State management uses React Context API. Axios handles API communication.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 231 0 R
/T (Application Tier \(Backend\): Node.js with Express.js \(or Python Flask alternative\). RESTful endpoints: /upload \(file intake\), /extract \(OCR+NLP\), /simplify \(RAG+LLM\), /history \(user reports\). Middleware handles authentication \(JWT\), file validation, and rate limiting. The backend orchestrates the pipeline, calling OCR, NLP, retrieval, and generation services sequentially.)
/E (Application Tier \(Backend\): Node.js with Express.js \(or Python Flask alternative\). RESTful endpoints: /upload \(file intake\), /extract \(OCR+NLP\), /simplify \(RAG+LLM\), /history \(user reports\). Middleware handles authentication \(JWT\), file validation, and rate limiting. The backend orchestrates the pipeline, calling OCR, NLP, retrieval, and generation services sequentially.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
