864 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (The text simplification metrics reveal a clear hierarchy of approaches. Rule-based simplification, while fast and interpretable, produced the lowest quality output \(BLEU-1 = 0.34\) due to its inability to handle context-dependent meanings or restructure complex sentences. Raw LLM generation without retrieval showed moderate improvement \(BLEU-1 = 0.52\) but suffered from occasional hallucinations and generic explanations lacking test- specific detail. The incremental addition of MedlinePlus knowledge, Testing.com reference ranges, and patient-specific value context each contributed measurable gains, culminating in the full RAG approach with BLEU-1 = 0.74 and Flesch score = 68.9.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
