/Title (c\) Large Language Model - GPT-4 / LLaMA: The LLM component generates patient- friendly explanations. GPT-4 \(OpenAI API\) provides state-of-the-art instruction following and safety alignment. LLaMA-2-7B-chat \(Meta\) offers an open-source alternative with competitive performance. The model receives structured prompts containing retrieved medical knowledge and patient-specific values, generating coherent, contextualized explanations. Temperature settings near 0.3 ensure factual consistency over creative variation.)
