/Title (d\) Retrieval-Augmented Generation Pipeline: The RAG pipeline combines dense passage retrieval with generative language modeling. A FAISS vector store indexes chunked medical knowledge. Sentence transformers encode queries and passages into dense vectors. At inference, relevant passages are retrieved and injected into the LLM prompt, grounding generation in authoritative sources rather than parametric memory alone. This architecture dramatically reduces hallucination and ensures explanations reflect current medical consensus.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2611 0 R
/Next 2622 0 R
>>
endobj
